From: TDVP <tdvp@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] tdvp: omit the optional StatusNotifier tray

The first TDVP migration image intentionally ships a small conventional
desktop: menu, window-list, status adapters and clock. Building the upstream
StatusNotifier tray would add dbusmenu solely for a component that is not yet
part of that product surface. Keep the upstream panel and its plugin ABI
unchanged, while excluding only that optional plugin from this profile.

Signed-off-by: TDVP <tdvp@example.invalid>
---
 src/widgets/meson.build | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/widgets/meson.build b/src/widgets/meson.build
index 82a93a8..fd4d1e1 100644
--- a/src/widgets/meson.build
+++ b/src/widgets/meson.build
@@ -1,5 +1,4 @@
 subdir('launchers')
 subdir('notify')
 subdir('spacing')
-subdir('tray')
 subdir('window-list')
